issue_comments.body:
I'm not sure I get what android (x86_64) fails.
I can propose two solutions:
1. Change default value for `work_to_do` from `-5000` to `0`
2. Or remove newly added condition 
```
if (gcstate->work_to_do < 0) {
    return;
}
```
